  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>We have,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>if</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>j</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mtd><mtd><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>if</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>otherwise</mi><mo>&#160;</mo></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p>Then,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mtable columnspacing=\"1em\" rowspacing=\"4pt\" columnalign=\"center center center\"><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>x</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>x</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>x</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>x</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>For maxima or minima,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Now,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo>'</mo><mo>'</mo></mrow></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>6</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo>'</mo><mo>'</mo></mrow></msup><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>( point of minima)</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo>'</mo><mo>'</mo></mrow></msup><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;( point of maxima)</p><p>Hence, required sum is</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>20</mn><mn>27</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8722;</mo><mfrac><mn>88</mn><mn>27</mn></mfrac></math></p>"
  }
